            ['id' => '16', 'title' => 'Congratulates the Said Foundation for its great success', 'sub' => 'The Oxford English Centre wishes to express its gratitude to the Said Foundation for last evening.', 'descs' => '<p>The Oxford English Centre wishes to express its gratitude to the Said Foundation for last evening, hosting such a magnificent event at Drapers&rsquo; Hall in London. Isaad Abumallouh, Director of Studies, on behalf of her excelling students and illustrious teachers, congratulates the Said Foundation for its great success and ever-developing impact on improving the lives of Palestinians in the region, as well as pushing the boundaries of English language education. By Investing in the young talented individuals of both Gaza and the West Bank, countless individuals have improved their lives and opportunities lighting up the future of the entire region. Well done to the students of the Oxford English Centre for being selected for the Said Foundation, following in the footsteps of achievers. Nothing less is expected from our students.&nbsp;</p>', 'onwer' => 'q', 'source' => null, 'image' => '/uploads/photos/shares/5d3efe2148c64.jpg', 'img_notes' => null, 'main' => '0', 'slider' => '0', 'comment' => '0', 'category_id' => '2', 'sidebar' => '0', 'others_id' => '0', 'publish' => '1', 'publish_id' => '0', 'sec_id' => '0', 'resort' => '7', 'views' => '619', 'tags' => 'Isaad Abumallouh,Abumallouh,ielts,oxford', 'pub_date' => '2019-07-20 16:56:08', 'user_id' => '7', 'updated_by' => '0', 'thumb' => '/uploads/photos/shares/thumbs/5d3efe2148c64.jpg', 'created_at' => '2019-07-17 10:42:13', 'updated_at' => '2025-01-07 14:47:12', 'deleted_at' => null, ],
            ['id' => '17', 'title' => 'Oxford at #SDGsGaza2030', 'sub' => 'The workshop, titled “Improvement of Life in Gaza by Delivery of Sustainable Development Goals: Challenges and Opportunities”', 'descs' => '<p>The workshop, titled&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://ctg.org/we-invite-you-to-join-our-sdg-workshop/\">&ldquo;Improvement of Life in Gaza by Delivery of Sustainable Development Goals: Challenges and Opportunities&rdquo;</a></u>, brought more than 120 people together to focus on the SDGs, with the goal to form an SDG Council to ensure an ongoing conversation about its outcomes from both public and private partners.</p>', 'onwer' => 'متابعات', 'source' => null, 'image' => '/uploads/photos/shares/5d3d7d0942ea7.jpg', 'img_notes' => null, 'main' => '0', 'slider' => '0', 'comment' => '0', 'category_id' => '3', 'sidebar' => '0', 'others_id' => '0', 'publish' => '1', 'publish_id' => '0', 'sec_id' => '0', 'resort' => '3', 'views' => '4038', 'tags' => null, 'pub_date' => '2018-07-23 20:33:56', 'user_id' => '12', 'updated_by' => '0', 'thumb' => '/uploads/photos/shares/thumbs/5d3d7d0942ea7.jpg', 'created_at' => '2018-07-23 20:33:56', 'updated_at' => '2025-01-08 16:39:58', 'deleted_at' => null, ],
            ['id' => '18', 'title' => '\"Female First career\" workshop', 'sub' => 'How to Stand out from the Crowd & Get the Job You Want', 'descs' => '<p>On Saturday 17 November 2018, Oxford English Centre in partnership with CTG conducted a &quot;Female First career&quot; workshop titled &ldquo;How to Stand out from the Crowd &amp; Get the Job You Want&ldquo;. Focusing on career-development and CV building, the workshop welcomed 25 recent female graduates every Saturday morning for 4 weeks, providing them with the opportunity to boost their understanding of tools such as LinkedIn, and further develop vital professional skills such as writing a great cover letter, as well as tips and tricks for interviews.</p>', 'onwer' => 'متابعات', 'source' => null, 'image' => '/uploads/photos/shares/5d3d77d5152a6.jpg', 'img_notes' => null, 'main' => '0', 'slider' => '0', 'comment' => '0', 'category_id' => '3', 'sidebar' => '0', 'others_id' => '0', 'publish' => '1', 'publish_id' => '0', 'sec_id' => '0', 'resort' => '2', 'views' => '3101', 'tags' => null, 'pub_date' => '2018-11-17 20:37:48', 'user_id' => '12', 'updated_by' => '0', 'thumb' => '/uploads/photos/shares/thumbs/5d3d77d5152a6.jpg', 'created_at' => '2018-07-23 20:37:48', 'updated_at' => '2025-01-10 11:12:46', 'deleted_at' => null, ],
            ['id' => '19', 'title' => '#Chevening_Orientation_Session_Gaza', 'sub' => 'It was great to co-host another Chevening orientation session with The British Consulate.', 'descs' => '<h3>It was great to co-host another Chevening orientation session with The British Consulate. For those interested in applying for Chevening 2019-2020 round, remember that the deadline is on 6th November 2018. Good Luck for all.</h3>', 'onwer' => 'q', 'source' => null, 'image' => '/uploads/photos/shares/5d3d7f6d16419.jpg', 'img_notes' => null, 'main' => '0', 'slider' => '0', 'comment' => '0', 'category_id' => '3', 'sidebar' => '0', 'others_id' => '0', 'publish' => '1', 'publish_id' => '0', 'sec_id' => '0', 'resort' => '1', 'views' => '2997', 'tags' => null, 'pub_date' => '2020-05-30 17:23:22', 'user_id' => '7', 'updated_by' => '0', 'thumb' => '/uploads/photos/shares/thumbs/5d3d7f6d16419.jpg', 'created_at' => '2019-07-17 10:42:13', 'updated_at' => '2025-01-09 15:41:22', 'deleted_at' => null, ],
            ['id' => '21', 'title' => '10 Reasons to Learn English', 'sub' => 'Thinking about learning English? Then read the top 10 reasons why you should get started right away in', 'descs' => '<p>Learning English is important and people all over the world decide to study it as a second language. Many countries include English as a second language in their school syllabus and children start learning English at a young age.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>However,&nbsp;<strong>do you know why</strong>&nbsp;learning English is so important? Here are ten good reasons to take an English language course.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p>1.&nbsp;English is the most commonly spoken language in the world. One out of five people can speak or at least understand English!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.&nbsp;English is the language of science, of aviation, computers, diplomacy, and tourism. Knowing English increases your chances of getting a good job in a multinational company within your home country or of finding work abroad.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3.&nbsp;English is the official language of 53 countries. That is a lot of people to meet and speak to.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4.&nbsp;English is spoken as a first language by around 400 million people around the world.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5.&nbsp;English is the language of the media industry. If you speak English, you won&#39;t need to rely on translations and subtitles anymore to enjoy your favourite books, songs, films and TV shows.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>6.&nbsp;English is also the language of the Internet. Many websites are written in English &ndash; you will be able to understand them and to take part in forums and discussions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>7.&nbsp;English is based on a simple alphabet and it is fairly quick and easy to learn compared to other languages.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>8.&nbsp;English is not only useful &ndash; it gives you a lot of satisfaction. Making progress feels great. You will enjoy learning English, if you remember that every hour you spend gets you closer to perfection.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>9.&nbsp;Since English is spoken in so many different countries there are thousands of schools around the world that offer programmes in English. If you speak English, there&#39;re lots of opportunities for you to find an appropriate school and course to suit your academic needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>10.&nbsp;Because it&#39;s fun! By learning English, you will also learn about other cultures. Few experiences will make you grow as a person more than learning the values, habits and way of life in a culture that is different from yours.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>If you want to learn English, please countact us&nbsp;to speak to a member of our team about our English courses&nbsp;in the UK.</strong></p>', 'onwer' => 'IEBRAHIM ALMASRI', 'source' => 'Oxford Centre', 'image' => '/uploads/photos/shares/images/5d48192cbfb24.jpg', 'img_notes' => null, 'main' => '0', 'slider' => '0', 'comment' => '0', 'category_id' => '2', 'sidebar' => '0', 'others_id' => '0', 'publish' => '1', 'publish_id' => '0', 'sec_id' => '0', 'resort' => '3', 'views' => '5864', 'tags' => '10 Reasons to Learn English,oxford,Gaza,ielts,test,level,english', 'pub_date' => '2021-02-15 13:47:55', 'user_id' => '16', 'updated_by' => '0', 'thumb' => '/uploads/photos/shares/images/thumbs/5d48192cbfb24.jpg', 'created_at' => '2019-08-05 13:47:55', 'updated_at' => '2025-01-10 11:52:24', 'deleted_at' => null, ],
            ['id' => '22', 'title' => 'CEFR LEVELS', 'sub' => 'Our General English Courses will help you improve in all areas of the English Language: vocabulary, speaking, listening...', 'descs' => '<p>Our General English Courses will help you improve in all areas of the English Language: vocabulary, speaking, listening, pronunciation, reading and writing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you&rsquo;re learning English for the first time or want to top up your skills, become an expert speaker or simply experience the joy of learning, we&rsquo;ve got the right course for you and your future.</p>\r\n\r\n<form action=\"https://www.facebook.com/ajax/ufi/modify.php\" data-ft=\"{\" tn=\"\">Book Now!</form>', 'onwer' => 'Oxford', 'source' => 'Oxford', 'image' => '/uploads/photos/shares/images/5e51173353237.jpg', 'img_notes' => null, 'main' => '0', 'slider' => '0', 'comment' => '0', 'category_id' => '2', 'sidebar' => '0', 'others_id' => '0', 'publish' => '1', 'publish_id' => '0', 'sec_id' => '0', 'resort' => '6', 'views' => '4489', 'tags' => 'oxford,english,test,ielts,gaza,facebook,google,level', 'pub_date' => '2021-02-18 16:02:03', 'user_id' => '16', 'updated_by' => '0', 'thumb' => '/uploads/photos/shares/images/thumbs/5e51173353237.jpg', 'created_at' => '2020-02-22 16:02:03', 'updated_at' => '2025-01-09 00:56:45', 'deleted_at' => null, ],
            ['id' => '23', 'title' => 'Photo from our last graduation!', 'sub' => 'Photo from our last graduation! \r\n  Congratulations and best of luck to everyone!', 'descs' => '<p>We said goodbye to some long term students! Best of luck for your future!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'onwer' => 'Oxford', 'source' => 'Oxford', 'image' => 'uploads/photos/shares/thumbs/5ef07d1936983.JPG', 'img_notes' => null, 'main' => '0', 'slider' => '0', 'comment' => '0', 'category_id' => '2', 'sidebar' => '0', 'others_id' => '0', 'publish' => '0', 'publish_id' => '0', 'sec_id' => '0', 'resort' => '5', 'views' => '0', 'tags' => 'Photo from our last graduation!   Congratulations and best of luck to everyone! ,oxford ,english,level,ielts,test', 'pub_date' => '2020-06-29 20:21:14', 'user_id' => '16', 'updated_by' => '0', 'thumb' => '/uploads/photos/shares/images/thumbs/5ef07d1936983.JPG', 'created_at' => '2020-06-22 13:49:01', 'updated_at' => '2021-03-08 13:08:24', 'deleted_at' => null, ],
            ['id' => '24', 'title' => 'English Language Instructors: 4 Vacancies', 'sub' => 'Oxford English Centre is currently seeking part-time English language instructors to be part of the team in Gaza.', 'descs' => '<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span new=\"\" roman=\"\" style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\"><b>DO YOU THINK<br />\r\nYOU CAN TEACH ENGLISH?</b></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span new=\"\" roman=\"\" style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\"><b><i>English Language Instructors: 4 Vacancies</i></b></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span new=\"\" roman=\"\" style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\">With more than 10 years experience delivering language services to adult language learners right across the Gaza Strip, Oxford English Centre enjoys a deserved reputation as one of Gaza most respected English language teaching organisations. We employ qualified staff of English language instructors who hold postgraduate degrees from sounding British and American Universities.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span new=\"\" roman=\"\" style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\">Oxford English Centre is currently seeking part-time English language instructors to be part of the team in Gaza.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span new=\"\" roman=\"\" style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\">They will be responsible for the delivery of quality English language programs to our clients on a day-to-day basis.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span new=\"\" roman=\"\" style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\"><b>Responsibilities</b>:</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span new=\"\" roman=\"\" style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\">&bull; Facilitating English langauge learning catering to a broad range of client needs<br />\r\n&bull; Delivering best educational practice aimed at developing language skills in learners<br />\r\n&bull; Creating engaging and effective learner-centred lesson plans<br />\r\n&bull; Assessing client progress and adjusting programs accordingly<br />\r\n&bull; Encouraging a climate of religious and cultural tolerance</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span new=\"\" roman=\"\" style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\"><b>You will need:</b></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span new=\"\" roman=\"\" style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\">&bull; Undergraduate degree in English Education or English Literature with an overall GPA of 80% or above<br />\r\n&bull; MA in TESOL, TEFL,CELTA, English Language Teaching or Applied Linguistics with a high merit or above<br />\r\n&bull; Valid IELTS certificate with an overall score of 7.5 (no less than 7 in each and every section)<br />\r\n&bull; Passion and motivation for English language teaching and learning</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span new=\"\" roman=\"\" style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\">Experience in teaching adult clients would be a major advantage.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span new=\"\" roman=\"\" style=\"font-family:\" times=\"\"><b>Copies of certificates, a cover letter and resume should be sent to Isaad Abumallouh/ Director of Studies : isaadmallouh@oxford.ps<br />\r\nbefore 12:00 AM, 5 July&nbsp;2020.</b></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"text-align:left; margin:0cm 0cm 10pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>', 'onwer' => 'Oxford', 'source' => 'Oxford', 'image' => '/uploads/photos/shares/images/5efa008862154.png', 'img_notes' => null, 'main' => '0', 'slider' => '0', 'comment' => '0', 'category_id' => '2', 'sidebar' => '0', 'others_id' => '0', 'publish' => '0', 'publish_id' => '0', 'sec_id' => '0', 'resort' => '4', 'views' => '277', 'tags' => 'work,job,jobs,ielts,english,teacher', 'pub_date' => '2021-02-20 14:26:55', 'user_id' => '16', 'updated_by' => '0', 'thumb' => '/uploads/photos/shares/images/thumbs/5efa008862154.png', 'created_at' => '2020-06-29 18:34:55', 'updated_at' => '2021-03-08 13:08:24', 'deleted_at' => null, ],
            ['id' => '25', 'title' => 'Discover IELTS preparation strategies', 'sub' => 'If you are planning to study abroad or move to another country to work or live, you may be asked to prove your English language ab', 'descs' => '<p>The course in Oxford Centre give you all the information and practice you need to approach all four parts of IELTS with confidence that you can achieve the band score you need.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In course you&rsquo;ll find:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>a description of each part of the test and what you have to do to achieve a good band score</li>\r\n	<li>the assessment criteria that tell you what your examiner is looking for</li>\r\n	<li>exam techniques to help you tackle all types of test questions</li>\r\n	<li>tips and strategies for successful test preparation and for improving your English ability</li>\r\n	<li>practice tests to help you know what to expect on test day</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt;\">As well as that, the course looks at common problems language learners have with that language skill:</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt;\"><strong>Speaking</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>how to give full and fluent answers to the examiner&rsquo;s questions</li>\r\n	<li>how to improve your confidence when speaking English</li>\r\n	<li>planning a short talk in English</li>\r\n	<li>finding enough to say</li>\r\n	<li>improving your pronunciation</li>\r\n	<li>the grammar you need for the test</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt;\"><strong>Reading</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>techniques like skimming and scanning to improve your test reading speed</li>\r\n	<li>reading about unfamiliar topics in English</li>\r\n	<li>improving your vocabulary and dealing with unknown words</li>\r\n	<li>coping with time pressure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt;\"><strong>Writing</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>understanding and describing charts and data</li>\r\n	<li>writing about trends</li>\r\n	<li>planning an essay</li>\r\n	<li>the grammar and vocabulary you need</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"LTR\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt;\"><strong>Listening</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>listening test techniques</li>\r\n	<li>widening your listening range</li>\r\n	<li>staying focused when you listen</li>\r\n	<li>listening to conversations in English</li>\r\n</ul>', 'onwer' => 'Oxford', 'source' => 'Oxfor', 'image' => '/uploads/photos/shares/________________________________1.png', 'img_notes' => null, 'main' => '0', 'slider' => '0', 'comment' => '0', 'category_id' => '2', 'sidebar' => '0', 'others_id' => '0', 'publish' => '1', 'publish_id' => '0', 'sec_id' => '0', 'resort' => '2', 'views' => '3600', 'tags' => 'ielts,english,oxford,university ,school,test,writing,speaking,reading,scholarship ,chivining', 'pub_date' => '2021-02-20 14:25:05', 'user_id' => '16', 'updated_by' => '0', 'thumb' => '/uploads/photos/shares/thumbs/________________________________1.png', 'created_at' => '2021-02-20 14:25:05', 'updated_at' => '2026-07-17 11:11:44', 'deleted_at' => null, ],
            ['id' => '26', 'title' => 'Happy Women\'s Day', 'sub' => 'Wishing all the lovely and beautiful ladies, Happy Women\'s Day. Keep a proud smile on your face.', 'descs' => '<h2>&quot;A challenged world is an alert world. Individually, we&#39;re all responsible for our own thoughts and actions - all day, every day. We can all choose to challenge and call out gender bias and inequality. We can all choose to seek out and celebrate women&#39;s achievements. Collectively, we can all help create an inclusive world.</h2>\r\n\r\n<h2>From challenge comes change, so let&#39;s all choose to challenge.&quot;</h2>', 'onwer' => 'Oxford', 'source' => 'Oxford', 'image' => '/uploads/photos/shares/womens_day_-_oxford.jpg', 'img_notes' => null, 'main' => '0', 'slider' => '0', 'comment' => '0', 'category_id' => '2', 'sidebar' => '0', 'others_id' => '0', 'publish' => '0', 'publish_id' => '0', 'sec_id' => '0', 'resort' => '1', 'views' => '3004', 'tags' => 'WOMAN,WOMEN,OXFORD,SDGS,GLOBAL,GENDER,REITH', 'pub_date' => '2024-07-01 12:52:22', 'user_id' => '16', 'updated_by' => '0', 'thumb' => '/uploads/photos/shares/thumbs/womens_day_-_oxford.jpg', 'created_at' => '2021-03-08 13:07:03', 'updated_at' => '2024-07-01 12:52:22', 'deleted_at' => null, ],
            ['id' => '27', 'title' => 'We are Official  Oxford Test  of English Exam Centre', 'sub' => 'The Oxford Test of English is the only English Language proficiency test certified by the University of Oxford.', 'descs' => '<h3 data-mce-style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Oxford Test of English is the only English Language proficiency test certified by the University of Oxford, which means it is quality assured by one of the leading educational institutes in the world.</h3>', 'onwer' => 'Oxford', 'source' => 'Oxford', 'image' => '/uploads/photos/shares/images/skynews-oxford-university-oxford_4132750.jpg', 'img_notes' => null, 'main' => '0', 'slider' => '0', 'comment' => '0', 'category_id' => '1', 'sidebar' => '1', 'others_id' => '0', 'publish' => '1', 'publish_id' => '0', 'sec_id' => '0', 'resort' => '1', 'views' => '19', 'tags' => 'oxford ,test,centre,english,oxford test of english', 'pub_date' => '2021-06-13 23:11:39', 'user_id' => '16', 'updated_by' => '0', 'thumb' => '/uploads/photos/shares/images/thumbs/skynews-oxford-university-oxford_4132750.jpg', 'created_at' => '2021-04-25 15:01:46', 'updated_at' => '2024-09-21 23:46:47', 'deleted_at' => null, ],
